    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/a31ce18a0a845ee79ba1257b2183a64b.avif?t=1749239781\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/34bafb3102d9b10eb1266711c17f7e3f.poster.avif?t=1749239781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/34bafb3102d9b10eb1266711c17f7e3f.webm?t=1749239781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/34bafb3102d9b10eb1266711c17f7e3f.mp4?t=1749239781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Welcome to Kitball 20000!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/32867948dca07800c618cfda610c473f.avif?t=1749239781\" /></div><br><br>Kitball is a homage to classic old-school <strong>Maze Shooters</strong> of the 90's era, featuring modernized gameplay and graphics, while still holding onto the original simplicity and charm of its inspiration.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/c588e94e6a89d480bd550387db7d9238.avif?t=1749239781\" /></div><br><br>Kitball 20000 features:<br>   - 4 Player Couch Split Screen action!  (Screen-Peeking encouraged)<br>   - Single Player mode with new enemy types in every level!<br>   - Randomly generated mazes for a unique experience every time!<br>   - Powerups to destroy your friends with!<br>   - Breakable terrain to create your own path to victory!<br>   - Voiced cutscenes!<br>   - A cat!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/7ec49f052aa5eca04915eea3880e6945.avif?t=1749239781\" /></div><br><br><strong>Best played with a Gamepad!</strong>  Navigate through randomly generated mazes, break through walls, and boost your way around corners to secure your victory in a free-for-all battle with your friends!  One shot, you die.  Be the last one standing and abuse the power of screen-peeking to your heart's content.  Speed through the map using your boost power, break through walls using your shots, or simply take it tactical and utilize the windows and one-way pathways to your advantage;  You play your way.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/a31ce18a0a845ee79ba1257b2183a64b.avif?t=1749239781\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/34bafb3102d9b10eb1266711c17f7e3f.poster.avif?t=1749239781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/34bafb3102d9b10eb1266711c17f7e3f.webm?t=1749239781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/34bafb3102d9b10eb1266711c17f7e3f.mp4?t=1749239781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Welcome to Kitball 20000!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/32867948dca07800c618cfda610c473f.avif?t=1749239781\" /></div><br><br>Kitball is a homage to classic old-school <strong>Maze Shooters</strong> of the 90's era, featuring modernized gameplay and graphics, while still holding onto the original simplicity and charm of its inspiration.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/c588e94e6a89d480bd550387db7d9238.avif?t=1749239781\" /></div><br><br>Kitball 20000 features:<br>   - 4 Player Couch Split Screen action!  (Screen-Peeking encouraged)<br>   - Single Player mode with new enemy types in every level!<br>   - Randomly generated mazes for a unique experience every time!<br>   - Powerups to destroy your friends with!<br>   - Breakable terrain to create your own path to victory!<br>   - Voiced cutscenes!<br>   - A cat!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204400/extras/7ec49f052aa5eca04915eea3880e6945.avif?t=1749239781\" /></div><br><br><strong>Best played with a Gamepad!</strong>  Navigate through randomly generated mazes, break through walls, and boost your way around corners to secure your victory in a free-for-all battle with your friends!  One shot, you die.  Be the last one standing and abuse the power of screen-peeking to your heart's content.  Speed through the map using your boost power, break through walls using your shots, or simply take it tactical and utilize the windows and one-way pathways to your advantage;  You play your way.",
